        44,
        103,
        331,
        147
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-02-panel-01",
      "text": "Oil. Bread. Sea.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1134,
        76,
        1418,
        119
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-02-panel-03",
      "text": "Father Duarte. I expected triumph,",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        33,
        24,
        777,
        89
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-02-panel-03",
      "text": "or at least satisfaction.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        33,
        103,
        527,
        154
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-02-panel-03",
      "text": "The stubborn Maratha, broken",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        828,
        29,
        1485,
        84
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-02-panel-03",
      "text": "at last.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        829,
        108,
        973,
        158
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-02-panel-04",
      "text": "A blessing, perhaps. Or an",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        38,
        31,
        610,
        96
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-02-panel-04",
      "text": "apology.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        38,
        110,
        221,
        175
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-02-panel-05",
      "text": "I filed his face away in the part of my mind that",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        47,
        50,
        760,
        95
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-02-panel-05",
      "text": "kept accounts.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        47,
        105,
        269,
        150
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-02-panel-05",
      "text": "Men who hesitate are men who can be used.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        47,
        632,
        723,
        668
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-02-panel-05",
      "text": "Someday, I thought, that hesitation might matter.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1092,
        627,
        1829,
        673
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-03-panel-01",
      "text": "Their eyes told a different story.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        34,
        61,
        610,
        115
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-03-panel-01",
      "text": "They weighed the value of the bodies",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1424,
        28,
        2095,
        82
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-03-panel-01",
      "text": "in chains.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1424,
        94,
        1600,
        136
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-03-panel-02",
      "text": "To Angola. Africa.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        45,
        56,
        268,
        94
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-03-panel-02",
      "text": "Not this one. The Jesuits need bodies for",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        415,
        83,
        933,
        113
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-03-panel-02",
      "text": "their lands to the south.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        414,
        129,
        717,
        159
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-03-panel-02",
      "text": "They will work us until we",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1070,
        64,
        1403,
        102
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-03-panel-02",
      "text": "forget our own names.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1070,
        111,
        1359,
        149
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-03-panel-03",
      "text": "Faster. The tide waits for no man. Not even",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        70,
        45,
        718,
        81
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-03-panel-03",
      "text": "maratas.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        70,
        103,
        203,
        136
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-03-panel-03",
      "text": "An old, absurd",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1788,
        387,
        2008,
        425
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-03-panel-03",
      "text": "thought.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1787,
        442,
        1912,
        487
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-03-panel-03",
      "text": "Horses would hate",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1829,
        535,
        2110,
        570
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-03-panel-03",
      "text": "this.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1828,
        590,
        1893,
        625
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-03-panel-04",
      "text": "The world of land, with its forts and fields and familiar dust, already felt far away.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        41,
        74,
        1743,
        136
      ],
      "light_fraction": 0.9955839429892726
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-04-panel-02",
      "text": "Prayers, in a script I could not",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        62,
        287,
        537,
        334
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-04-panel-02",
      "text": "read.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        62,
        344,
        143,
        381
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-04-panel-02",
      "text": "Another prisoner, another ship, another journey",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1222,
        287,
        1973,
        334
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-04-panel-02",
      "text": "that ended somewhere in chains.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1222,
        344,
        1746,
        381
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-04-panel-03",
      "text": "Sahib.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1087,
        78,
        1224,
        130
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-04-panel-03",
      "text": "In camp I had insisted he use my name. We were both sons of",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        45,
        741,
        1409,
        806
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-04-panel-03",
      "text": "the Deccan.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        44,
        820,
        303,
        871
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-04-panel-03",
      "text": "Now there was comfort in the old military habit.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        45,
        900,
        1089,
        965
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-04-panel-04",
      "text": "Rao. You are still alive.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        177,
        78,
        677,
        130
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-04-panel-04",
      "text": "For now.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1017,
        86,
        1208,
        137
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-04-panel-05",
      "text": "And the ship began to move.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        42,
        51,
        428,
        91
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-04-panel-05",
      "text": "Do you know where they",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1500,
        615,
        1835,
        656
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-04-panel-05",
      "text": "send us?",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1500,
        664,
        1624,
        696
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-05-panel-01",
      "text": "South. That much is certain.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        36,
        60,
        613,
        108
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-05-panel-01",
      "text": "They need men to cut cane.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        701,
        57,
        1268,
        118
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-05-panel-01",
      "text": "Fields of sugar as tall as a man.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        701,
        132,
        1358,
        193
      ],
      "light_fraction": 0.9997504803253736
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-05-panel-01",
      "text": "We will sweat for their",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1506,
        60,
        1970,
        108
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-05-panel-01",
      "text": "salvation.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1506,
        135,
        1704,
        183
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-05-panel-02",
      "text": "Near Chaul he dared",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        743,
        102,
        1098,
        143
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-05-panel-02",
      "text": "the Portuguese to",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        743,
        165,
        1048,
        217
